      "id": "transaction-manual",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Service/ClassService.php:68",
        "lib/Service/ClassService.php:102",
        "lib/Service/ExportService.php:274",
        "lib/Service/NoteService.php:152",
        "lib/Service/TransferService.php:43",
        "lib/Service/TrashService.php:236"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "6 transactions are opened and closed by hand. The trait TTransactional has atomic() since Nextcloud 24 and atomicRetry() since Nextcloud 27, which repeats a transaction that ran into a deadlock, as the manual recommends.",
        "  lib/Service/ClassService.php:68",
        "  lib/Service/ClassService.php:102",
        "  lib/Service/ExportService.php:274",
        "  lib/Service/NoteService.php:152",
